## Summary

Update the `work` command to emit a WorkStarted event with the jj change-id when starting work on a bug.

## Implementation

In `src/commands/work.rs`:

```rust
pub fn work(bug_id: &str) -> Result<()> {
    let store = Store::open()?;

    // 1. Create workspace (existing logic)
    let ws_path = create_workspace(bug_id)?;

    // 2. Get the workspace's change-id
    let change_id = jj::current_change_id_in(&ws_path)?;

    // 3. Record WorkStarted event
    let event = Event::work_started(bug_id, &change_id);
    store.append_event(&event)?;

    // 4. Also update status to InProgress (existing logic)
    // ...

    Ok(())
}
```

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] WorkStarted event emitted when work starts
- [ ] Change-id captured from workspace
- [ ] Event written to state branch
- [ ] docket show displays working change-id
- [ ] Existing work command behavior preserved

